VUS (Volume Under the Surface) metrics
  Files: evaluation/vus/metricor.py, and the get_range_vus_roc / VUS
         computation in evaluation/vus/__init__.py
  Source: https://github.com/TheDatumOrg/VUS (originally johnpaparrizos/VUS)
  Reference: J. Paparrizos, P. Boniol, T. Palpanas, R. Tsay, A. Elmore,
             M. Franklin. "Volume Under the Surface: A New Accuracy
             Evaluation Measure for Time-Series Anomaly Detection."
             PVLDB 15(11): 2774-2787, 2022.
  Only the `metricor` class and `generate_curve` needed to compute
  Range-AUC and VUS were vendored; the unused model zoo and plotting
  helpers were removed. Logic is kept faithful to reproduce published
  baseline numbers.
